{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"coding","tool":"write_file","arguments":{"name":"primary-publication-README.md","content":"Reusable primary-publication lookup\n\nRun primary-publication.js with input {\"entry_id\":\"<PDB identifier>\"} using the coding run_code tool. The script performs credential-free public GET reads against RCSB GraphQL and Crossref works. It requires the requested entry to exist, RCSB's citation id to be primary, and a DOI to be present. It resolves that DOI through Crossref and requires a matching DOI, journal-article type, and matching normalized publication title. It returns entry_id, DOI, Crossref's exact title array, and publisher. These checks distinguish the primary publication from a structure dataset DOI. Any missing or inconsistent evidence throws an error; report UNABLE with the reason rather than inventing metadata. No entry-specific result is retained in this solution.\n"},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"coding","tool":"write_file","arguments":{"name":"primary-publication-README.md","content":"Reusable primary-publication lookup\n\nRun primary-publication.js with input {\"entry_id\":\"<PDB identifier>\"} using the coding run_code tool. The script performs credential-free public GET reads against RCSB GraphQL and Crossref works. It requires the requested entry to exist, RCSB's citation id to be primary, and a DOI to be present. It resolves that DOI through Crossref and requires a matching DOI, journal-article type, and matching normalized publication title. It returns entry_id, DOI, Crossref's exact title array, and publisher. These checks distinguish the primary publication from a structure dataset DOI. Any missing or inconsistent evidence throws an error; report UNABLE with the reason rather than inventing metadata. No entry-specific result is retained in this solution.\n"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"name\":\"primary-publication-README.md\",\"bytes\":787}"}],"structured_content":null},"error":null,"status":"completed"}}
